  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products:</p><p>ENDGAME is built around the mindset of pushing past limits — on and off the road.<br>Inspired by motorsport culture, street builds, and performance lifestyle, every piece represents progression, discipline, and identity.</p><p>This isn’t just apparel.<br>It’s a statement.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• What makes us different:</p><p>We’re not chasing trends.<br>We’re building a culture.</p><p>ENDGAME stands for:</p><ul><li><p>Performance mindset</p></li><li><p>Real builds and real community</p></li><li><p>Clean, aggressive design inspired by motorsport</p></li></ul><p>No hype. No shortcuts.<br>Only progression.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn:</p><p>As part of the ENDGAME Ambassador Division, you’ll represent the brand and share it with your audience.</p><p>You’ll receive:</p><ul><li><p>A personal access link</p></li><li><p>A custom crew code</p></li></ul><p>Earn {commission_amount} on referrals made through your link or code.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us:</p><p>Keep it real and aligned with the culture.</p><p>You can promote ENDGAME through:</p><ul><li><p>Car content / builds</p></li><li><p>Photography &amp; reels</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle posts</p></li><li><p>Events, meets, and community features</p></li></ul><p>Show how you live it — not just wear it.</p><p><br>• Other information:</p><p>This is a curated division.<br>We’re looking for people who align with the mindset — not just numbers.</p><p>Consistency. Authenticity. Progression.</p><p>This is where limits die.</p></div></div>",
